#
# A check that looks in the wrong place, or is given nothing, still passes,
# so CI also fails when a count falls below its floor here. Each floor is
# 90% of the count measured on the date beside it. Once the code has grown
# so that a floor is below 70% of today's count, ./s/lint, ./s/test and
# ./s/frontend raise it to 90% again themselves: commit this file with the
# work when they do.
